<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67991" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μισθαρν-έω</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεμισθάρνηκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.154
				</span></i>
			:—<i>work</i> or <i>serve for hire</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσοι μισθαρνοῦντες ἤνυσαν τάδε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					302
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				346b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.49
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν βαναύσων καὶ μισθαρνούντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1296b29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ μισθαρνοῦντες τῶν ῥητόρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2.56
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ -αρνῶν ὄχλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cat. Mi.</u>
					44
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. παρά τινος</span>
			<i>receive pay</i> from . . , <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.236
			</span></i>; esp. of prostitution, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ σώματι μ.</span>
			<i>quaestum corpore facere</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				59.20
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
			</span></i> l. c., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMagd.</u>
				14.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>.</div>
